# Input

```svelte
{#await thePromise catch theCatch}the value is {theCatch}{/await}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1 +1,3 @@
-{#await thePromise catch theCatch}the value is {theCatch}{/await}
+{#await thePromise catch theCatch}
+    the value is {theCatch}
+{/await}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#await thePromise catch theCatch}
    the value is {theCatch}
{/await}
```
